    "summary": "Finishes spec 108 §10 by making Factory sync asynchronous (PubSub-driven) and wires Personal Access Tokens into the two repo access surfaces the platform owns: (a) org-level PAT for the Factory upstream sources (goa-software-factory + template), and (b) per-project PAT for project repos that live outside the org and cannot be reached via the OAP GitHub App. Resolves the spec 108 §10 inline-vs-PubSub open question.\n",
